  12:      performs the merge as `app/github-actions`, and events raised by
  13:      GITHUB_TOKEN never start a workflow run (AGENTS.md hard rule 14). Of the
  14:      last 6 merges, the 5 app-performed ones produced ZERO push runs; only the
  15:      one merged by a human PAT produced a run.
